{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126191716827103232"]},"author_id":"2125833977043046400","created_at":"2026-11-27T05:49:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126191727228993813"],"id":"2126191727228993813","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":77,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Google is reportedly preparing to enter the personal AI agent race with a new offering called Gemini Bots.\n\nSources suggest the platform is being built to go head-to-head with Grok Bots and ChatGPT Dots. Here’s how it works:\n\n- A two-tier system: Gemini Neon handles reasoning and https://t.co/o1iGT859LJ","url":"https://x.com/FelixSpark1bb1/status/2126191727228993813"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126092222882025472","3_2126092222882045952","3_2126092222886195200","3_2126092222894686209","3_2126092222898884608"]},"author_id":"720137932363931649","created_at":"2026-11-27T04:02:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126164612064415897"],"id":"2126164612064415897","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":160,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Grok Bot 团队工程师 Lauren Tan（网友叫她「土豆姐」）上周四发了一篇长文，讲怎么把活真正交给\nBot。不到一周，309 万次浏览、3.3 万人收藏，马斯克亲自转发，配文是「把 Grok Bot 当成一个特别\n聪明的员工来用」。 https://t.co/kqQQUUJbif","url":"https://x.com/momocon_ai/status/2126164612064415897"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126158518394773504","3_2126158518365364224"]},"author_id":"1053548353412198400","created_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126158535247474848"],"id":"2126158535247474848","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I documented reproducible orchestration gaps across ChatGPT, Dots and Work, built workarounds, and submitted a formal engineering escalation and compensation request.\n\nTechnical evidence and reproduction steps attached.\n\n@OpenAI @OpenAIDevs @ChatGPTapp https://t.co